  "id": "arugula-and-strawberry-salad-with-feta",
  "name": "Arugula and Strawberry Salad with Feta",
  "subtitle": "Peppery greens with berries, feta, and toasted almonds",
  "description": "A fresh salad combining arugula, sliced strawberries, salty feta, and toasted almonds with a simple balsamic dressing.",
